OL,4,CMyanmar committed genocide against     
OL,5,CRohingya minority, top UN court rules  
OL,6,GMyanmar has been found guilty of       
OL,7,Gcommitting genocide against its        
OL,8,GRohingya minority by the International 
OL,9,GCourt of Justice (ICJ).                
OL,11,FThe verdict marks the first time a     
OL,12,Fstate has ever been found to have      
OL,13,Fcommitted genocide by an international 
OL,14,Fcourt.                                 
OL,16,FYuji Iwasawa, president of the UN's    
OL,17,Ftop court, said Myanmar had the        
OL,18,F"intention to destroy" a substantial   
OL,19,Fpart of the Rohingya population and    
OL,20,Fengaged in "extensive destruction of   
OL,21,Fevidence" to hide its crimes.          
